  "details": "**Description**\n\nWe can click accept check of Request Invite notification on the menu.\n\nHowever, it's impossible to invite (accept request invite) while I'm in friends instance of another user.\n\nSo, it should be impossible to click check button as I'm in invite instance of another user.\n\n**日本語要約**\n\n他人のFriends Onlyでnon-ownerがreqinを受信したとき、 ☑が押せてしまうバグです\n\n**Related Canny**\n\nI and my friend wrote multiple Canny about Request Invite.\n\nRequest Inviteに関わる同時に書いた他のCannyがいくつかあります\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-grayed-out-or-not-present-when-im-in-an\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-if-im-in-friends-instance (this canny)\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-clickable-after-moving-to-friends-or-pu\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-after-moving-to-invite-in",
